rooms_desc ({"This is the main hallway of Misticalla's house.  Thereare plush rugs on the floors and scented flowers scatteredabout the room.  To the north are some stairs leading down.To the south is a great room.  To the west is the kitchen.","This is a surprisingly large room with soft fluffycarpet.  On one side of the room is a large hot tubthat also serves as a bathtub.  There are two robeshanging on hooks on the walls next to plush towels.There are dials to turn on the jets for bubbles, andthe water is always warm.  There is also a shower  here and the room is lined with mirrorson the walls and on the ceiling.  There is a beautifulfresh flowery scent due to the candles that are placedin various places in the room.","As you enter you notice a distinct odor and light filtering into the room.You recognize the odor as you gaze around and see a large indoor swimmingpool.  It has a diving board and a curvy slide.  There are sunning chairsand a few tables scattered about the wooden floor.  You notice theroom is entirely enclosed by glass.  You feel warmed by the sun, and aretempted to take a swim.  Your mind wanders to memories of an eveningdip in the water, under the stars with someone close to you.","As you enter the garden, you are overwhealmed by thescent of various flowers.  You see roses of many colors,daffodils, tulips, lilies, geraniums, begonias, posies,and orchids.  There are violets, Misticalla's favorites,nestled in the soft clover.  Look at each flower for a special meaning.  To the south is a door thata leads to thehot tub.  To the north is a mysterious door.  Itappears to be locked.","This is Misti's kitchen.  There are all the basic necessities here.  Astove, refridgerator, sink, and dishwasher.  There is a round table offto one side of the room.  There are a few plants and flowers around the room.  Help yourself to anything you desire.","This is Misticalla's torture chamber.  If you pissher off or upset her, this is where you wind up.There is a block for chopping off heads of all sizes,and a large bloody axe.  A bucket sits next tothe block.  There are chains on the walls withshackles.  A long board hooked up with gears serves as a stretching machine, pulling apartit's victims limb by limb.  It is very darkin here and it smells terrible.  You wonderwhat lies in the dark corners ...","This is a balcony off of the house that leads to andfrom the pool.  As you gaze off in the distance yousee the great beauty of the mountains and hear thesound of a brook that runs through the land and toa large lake.  Look at the view and enjoy.","The first thing you notice as you walk into the room isthe large bed in the center of the room.  There are hugepillows on the flowered comforter.  The carpetis soft as you walk around the room.  You notice thatthere are mirrors above the bed.  There is a bay windowwith cushions for Misticalla to sit on while she reads.Candles light the room for a romantic atmosphere.","This room has vault ceilings and large pillars in the entryways.  There is a large screen TV withdigital sound, a stereo with large speakers, Cdchanger, dual cassette, and microphone jack.  TheTV is equipped with a Sega Genesis, Super Nintendo,and Sega CD.  There is a computer in one corner ofthe room.  It has everything from CD ROM to a VirtualReality hookup.  To the north is the main hall.  Tothe east is the bedroom.  There is a exit to thewest.","This room has vines hanging from the ceiling foryou to swing on.  There is a pool of water deepenough for you to land in.  You can splasharound if you want.  This room serves as a playroom for everyone to mess around in.  Loud musicis playing from hidden speakers and colored lightscast an erie glow on the water.   ",})
rooms_short ({"Misticalla's House","Bathroom and Hot Tub","Pool","A small garden.","Kitchen","Torture Chamber","The Balcony and Deck","Misticalla's Bedroom","Great Room","All Purpose Room",})
